WEBVTT

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.000
<b>Fifth Day as a Superhero: "Quit Patching It Up With Tape!"</b>

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.540
We will now announce the winner 
of this year's Grand Prix.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:12.000
The winner will not only 
walk way with the prestige,

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.510
but also a 100 million gold 
to set up their business.

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:17.560
Without further ado,

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:19.800
the winner of this year's 
Golden Toilet Seat is...

00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:22.010
Me?

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:26.820
Please give him a big hand, everyone!

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:29.960
Thank you very much.

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:33.340
First, I'd like to the thank the organizers, 
the Number One Toilet Seat Group

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:35.020
and the Big Ben Group.

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:37.830
And I'd also like to thank 
my wife and daughter.

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:40.220
Can you come home tonight?

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:42.440
Nah, I have to submit a new

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:45.200
toilet seat plan to the client ASAP.

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:47.900
I'm in a meeting. Don't call me.

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:50.050
Hey, we're presenting the new product here.

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:51.420
Pay attention!

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:53.420
With the support of my family,

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.460
I managed to finish the

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:58.880
revolutionary Internet Smart Toilet Seat.

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:02.510
You still can't come home?

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.510
Min-chan has a seafood allergy!

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:04.060
Can't say I appreciate checking your 
phone during a business dinner.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:02.510
She's in a lot of pain.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.020
I apologize.

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:10.100
For the sake of the toilet seat 
world over the next century,

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:12.440
we must keep seeking new frontiers!

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:15.100
Oh, you're the so-called toilet seat prince?

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.480
You're really famous.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:19.240
Wow, is this a new product?

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.560
A detachable butt-cleaning toilet seat?

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:23.200
So fancy! I wanna sit on it!

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:26.090
Hang on a sec. I've got a call.

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:27.870
Hello? What is it?

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.320
Don't call me for that crap.

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:33.680
Just call someone to repair it, or replace it.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:35.340
Quit calling me for everything.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.430
<i>In addition, we've also introduced</i>

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:40.260
<i>a cutting-edge touch system.</i>

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.120
<i>By connecting to the Wi-Fi...</i>

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:43.680
<b>Wife
Calling</b>

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.760
Your wife's calling.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.000
I'm in a meeting—

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.120
<i>Let's get divorced.</i>

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:57.130
Dude, were you strangling me all night?

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:58.820
No wonder I had such a bad dream.

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:00.590
You dumb local creature.

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:03.320
At least die once or twice, 
or killing you won't be worth it.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:04.990
<b>Abeshi!</b>

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:04.990
<b>Sorry I'm immortal!</b>

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.120
Hey, Yamada-san! You seriously 
want us to live together?!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:11.100
Did you get a leaseholder's 
foreigner resident permit?

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:11.820
Wait a second.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:15.590
I need a resident permit to 
stay on this tiny blue planet?

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:16.960
I have an idea, Fatty.

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:19.330
You seem quite skilled, 
so would you like to work for me?

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.200
Be my right hand and assist 
me until I become emperor.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:25.450
This guy's quite good at Japanese, 
even though he's an alien.

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:26.940
Why is he better than me?

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.180
He keeps using these difficult 
phrases, one after another.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:34.790
I studied just a little, to seize the 
heart of the female glober next door.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.360
I used all episodes of <i>AiPre</i> as reference.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.860
<i>AiPre</i>

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:39.610
Hey. What did you just say?

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.570
Scared, are we?

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.410
I can even sing the opening theme.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.160
<b>Pre, Pre, Pre ♪</b>

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.580
<b>Run papa~ ♪</b>

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:48.460
No! Before that!

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:51.160
I will not let you put 
the moves on Min-chan!

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.830
Oh? So you call her Min-chan?

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.500
Right, you were head over 
heels for her, too.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.850
You're out of luck. You're up against the 
most formidable rival in the universe.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:00.690
Are you stupid? I'm not your rival!

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:02.610
Then why get so worked up?

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:03.720
Min-chan, haa haa.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.030
Min-chan, haa haa!

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:06.380
Seriously, stop that!

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:09.800
There, there. I get that you're both 
crazy about Min-chan next door.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:13.300
That aside, my pair and your pairs

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:14.240
add up to six in total.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:15.950
Eat them and make up.

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:20.590
Oh, Min-chan from next door!

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:23.320
Speak of the devil! Commando! 
Lick-o! Nipslip-o!

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.180
Mr. Yamada...

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:27.570
The tap for our bathtub broke again.

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:29.250
The plumber said he'd take a while,

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.560
and I put my clothes in the washing 
machine and have nothing to wear.

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.330
Would you please help me out?

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:33.830
Please?

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.330
Me! Me! I'll help you!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.000
I won't give you the chance!

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:38.680
Face Punch!

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:42.340
I'm a superhero, y'know? 
What's with this treatment?

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.670
Not this fatty again!

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:47.430
You're stalking me because I'm a 
pretty, little high school girl?

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.530
Mister, please call the cops or the JSDF!

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:51.490
I wanna boom shakalaka with you, missy!

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.320
Wait, I'm talking all weird again.

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:54.860
Please, my beloved.

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:56.520
Would you spread your legs a bit more

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:58.020
and let me witness a beautiful sight?

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:01.380
Sorry, these two are distant 
relatives of mine.

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:02.630
Relatives?

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:05.400
Didn't you enter my room without 
permission the other day?

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:08.200
It wasn't on purpose. I was drunk that day.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:11.230
I didn't know where the bathroom was 
because I was new and got it wrong.

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:12.700
My future wife,

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.520
instead of letting this fatty in, 
invite me into your room.

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.460
Step on me and hit me all you want!

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.710
I'll scream in a more pleasant 
voice than a fatty.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:21.340
Don't get ahead of yourself, young'un!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.500
You'll get in Min-chan's 
room over my dead body.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.050
They're weirdos, but whatever.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:27.510
So, can either you of repair plumbings?

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.430
Me!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.430
Me!

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:34.750
This tap keeps breaking, no matter 
how many times we fix it.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.600
Sit back and watch, pleb.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:40.550
As a future king, I cannot let 
my subjects do all the fighting.

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:43.820
Hey, why're you making such a 
big deal out of fixing a tap?

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:47.840
Just by speaking, you expose 
your shallow nature.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.690
You must observe everything 
from the bottom of your heart.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:53.200
The only way to figure out the 
root of the problem is...

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.630
How original!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.700
Instead of fixing the leak,

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:04.980
he wants to drink up all the water?

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:07.290
<i>Theoretically, it's possible.</i>

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:10.520
<i>But this pipe is connected to the 
entire city's water network.</i>

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:13.550
<i>That means he'll have to drink 
up all the city's water!</i>

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:15.310
<i>And it won't stop there!</i>

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:18.610
<i>The water company gets its supply 
from the rivers and ocean outside!</i>

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:19.850
<i>Aliens are terrifying!</i>

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:22.910
<i>Is he trying to drink up 
all the ocean water, too?!</i>

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:24.040
<i>Wait, Alien.</i>

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:27.300
<i>Don't tell me your true aim 
is to complete your conquest</i>

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:30.580
<i>by drinking up all of Earth's 
water and parching it?</i>

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:33.740
<i>Then I must stop you before 
you do, no matter what!</i>

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:37.220
My monologue was pointless.

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:39.280
He was just a stupid alien.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:41.020
Min-chan, he drowned!

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.050
This is terrible!

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:44.000
Wait, I'll call for help right away!

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:46.610
This is my fault.

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:47.390
I can keep going.

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:50.010
You're gonna keep drinking? 
You're not done? Way to go, Prince!

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.530
Hey, hold this down for me.

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:57.910
Getting a superhero and a 
planet's prince to fix it?

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:59.700
What does this tap think it is?

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:02.460
No, this is my fault.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:05.160
I should've fixed it properly,

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:06.530
a long time ago.

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:10.550
You make it sound like you've 
been here for a long time.

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:11.910
That's right.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:15.350
This is my home.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.300
Hurry up and come home.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.500
The tap in the bath broke again.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.670
Min-chan's still in there. 
She'll catch a cold.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.030
Don't call me for that crap.

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:28.260
Just call someone to repair 
it, or replace it.

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:32.060
Eek! Don't give a facial, dammit!

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:35.190
Hey, rotten old man! I told 
you to fix the tap, didn't I?

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:36.940
Quit patching it up with tape!

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:38.350
What are you, a beginner?

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:41.210
Fix this, fix that, fix everything.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.190
You're just like your mom.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:45.140
I told her to replace it,

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:48.030
but she replaced me instead.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:00.280
I may have become a superhero,

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:04.100
but I can't even make Min-chan happy?

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:07.170
I guess...

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:10.910
some things just can't be 
fixed once they break.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:12.570
Wait a second.

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:15.140
Did you say this was your home, just now?

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:16.390
Then, is Min-chan...

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.520
Yeah, Min-chan...

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:22.860
is my only daughter.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:25.670
<i>I blurted out the truth!</i>

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:28.610
<i>Huh? I actually managed to 
say what I wanted to say.</i>

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:32.150
I see. Since he's an alien, I don't 
have to keep it a secret from him.

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:34.720
I see. So Min-chan's your daughter, fatty.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.820
No wonder you won't leave her alone.

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:40.700
Um...

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:40.700
Um...

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:47.630
I have a favor to ask!

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:47.630
I have a favor to ask!

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:49.490
Go ahead.

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:50.840
You first.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.740
No, you first.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.010
I love Min-chan, Father!

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:57.680
<b>Abeshi again!</b>

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:57.680
<b>Eat a sandal punch!</b>

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:00.140
I bought a swim ring!

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:02.900
Is he still drowning?

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:06.230
Where'd they go?

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:10.330
Oh, they fixed it?

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:17.470
They look like perverts, 
but they're actually quite helpful, huh?

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.990
Huh? It's still leaking?

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:27.160
Tape again. What are you, beginners?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:28.250
Huh?

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:31.560
Old man?

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:35.420
That stupid son of mine!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.420
<b>Planet Tenaricent</b>

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:38.470
Please suppress your rage, Great Emperor!

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:40.960
Selling the ship to stay on Earth?

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:42.940
Just how selfish is he?

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:44.100
Father.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:47.980
No need to worry. We can stop 
this from getting any worse.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:50.460
Let me deal with

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.940
my useless older brother.

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:58.030
Is it you, Min-chan?

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:04.030
Who?
